OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrests after man stabbed
OL,4,Aoutside house
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fman was stabbed outside a house in the
OL,8,Fearly hours of Sunday morning.
OL,10,FA man in his 20s was stabbed in
OL,11,FWindermere Drive in Worcester at around
OL,12,F06:00 GMT, West Mercia Police said.
OL,14,FHe was taken to hospital where his
OL,15,Finjuries are not believed to be
OL,16,Flife-threatening.
OL,18,FA 19-year-old man and a 17-year-old boy
OL,19,Fhave been arrested on suspicion of
OL,20,Fcausing grievous bodily harm and remain
OL,21,Fin police custody.
